B.If=s(["Architected and shipped the backend for a UK-market raffle platform in 97 days, scaling to 120K+ active users post-launch.","Built the Instant Win engine: deterministic windowed draws and atomic prize-pool allocation, guaranteeing a single winner per prize under concurrent load.","Owned the deposit flow end-to-end, shipping custom UPI and CVV-less payments that lifted transaction success by 30%.","Drove Flutter architecture on Junglee Rummy with modular Clean Architecture, custom plugins, a 30% smaller app, and Shorebird OTA releases on Bitbucket + Fastlane CI/CD.","Built an LLM-based PR review system that flags architecture violations, performance regressions, and convention drift, adopted team-wide."],t.s)
